        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Krypton, gaseous, at regional storage
Large uncertainties for equipment used due to weak data from small air separation plants. Process refers to an estimated air separation plant with 80'000 t liquid products per year. Assumed life time 20 years.;
CAS number: 007439-90-9; 
Formula: Kr; 
UUID: 57d3e0fb-83b1-382e-80c1-0982b0ee6d05
Rail and road transport prom production place (Europe) to Switzerland. Estimation for storage infrastructure .
Location: Estimated with European distances
Technology: Estimated. No specific technology modelled. Tranport requirement of steel cylinder included.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimation with standard distances and proxy for infrastrucutre 
Extrapolations: Distances and transport mode from standard distances used. Infrastructure represents only a rougth estimate.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_57d3e0fb-83b1-382e-80c1-0982b0ee6d05.xml</text>
